      {
        "id": 198370,
        "name": "McBehrer",
        "username": "McBehrer",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-05-26T01:17:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For the record, I think I was the first person to discover the whole Chairman respawning thing. Several years ago, back when Christopher was holding a Google Plus hangout to pitch the idea of Galactic Strike Force to us playtesters (so JUST after Shattered Timelines, I guess?) I kept him after to ask some rule clarifications, and that was one I asked about.</p>\n<p>According to him, even HE hadn’t realized that that interaction could happen, but he confirmed that it was, in fact, how it worked.</p>\n<p>So, yeah. I found that! Just something I’m proud of.</p>",
        "post_number": 23,
