        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bolnerap/{size}/6056_2.png",
        "created_at": "2017-06-01T00:39:08.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The key for me was combining Updated Intel (putting the Contract on top of the Chairman's deck) with Resilient Hide + Rhino + Indomitable Force. Contract, Hired Gun, and the environment all whiffed at our team that round, while the environment did plenty of damage to the enemies.</p>",
